Z||000000||2FASTOM||08-31-2001||09:10 AM||||Well I just bought my 87GT two months ago and its got a lot of extra goodies like K+N,Osclet exhaust(with no cats, superchip,short shifter, and a like new getreg 5spd.) In the little time I've had it there has been no shortage of "RICE" that wants to attempt to beat my GT, but when a S2000 pulled next to me at a light and reved up I thought I was done for. I had my windows down and I told him his honda stands a chance but it will never rumble like this(as I intimidated his VETC with my 5K rumble) I threw it into first and the light turned green, he jumped two feet in front of me and stalled! I took off and all he saw was hazard flashers and a big red PONTIAC. Well as all true ricers do he raced up to catch me(as I was cruising at the speed limit) and pulled aside me for the second time he paced my speed for a while reving every now and again then I threw it in third and shot off as I hear his 9K red line whining in the background.(and to my suprize he never could pass me!) He followed me for about ten miles and we never caught another light but if you pulled next to a 40K$ S2000 I would not be that worried about loosing.||||reg||11
