Z||000009||TRiAD||09-03-2001||11:00 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by firstfiero:<BR><B>    That's a stupid response Triad...</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Thanks. I enjoy having my responses called "stupid". <P>Seems to me, people here are always martyring themselves on the assumption that everyone talks bad about Fieros without having direct experience with them. <P>Have you ever driven an S2000? Or anything else that runs 0-60 in 5.5? How about any of the Type-R engines, or other engines that rely on VTEC (like the S2000 does) to make high end power? <BR><B>No. You haven't.</B><P>To say the 5.5 second to 60 S2000 "not that quick off the line" is what's stupid.<BR>To think that the guy who posted this thread (who's a newbie here) posted a real "kill" story, and wasn't simply fishing for Fiero friends is silly. <P>No, I don't doubt that someone unfamiliar with how to drive the S2000 to it's full potential could be out on the town. Some parents with them let their kids drive them. <I>However</I>, it doesn'yt take a genius to make a car perform at 1/2 it's potential, which in reality is all it would take to beat this Fiero. <P>You guys need to be a bit more realistic with what stories you believe posted here. <BR>||||reg||1
