Z||000026||TRiAD||09-04-2001||07:25 PM||||Really not sure what to make of that last post, but since from my perspective, this isn't a personal thing, I'll ignore it. <P>Someone said VTEC wasn't a top-end enhancer, and someone else said that's exactly what it is. What the first guy meant it seems, is that VTEC isn't <I>only</I> a top-end enhancer, so you're both right. <P>As for proving that I drove one, call Mike at Woody's Automotive in Creve Coeur, IL (this is the internet, look it up), and ask him if Mike from TRiAD Motorsports drove his buddy's black S2000 there one night. You can even ask him if I had a "large" passenger. I don't lie, no matter the circumstances. <P>Anyway, this is dumb, it didn't need to get personal. I'd think someone with 5 posts would try harder <I>not</I> to be a troll. <BR>But like I said...this is the internet. I guess I'll have to live with it. <P>...But having an opinion that differs with yours 2fastom, does NOT make me a "deamond", whatever that is. Obviously you're the one afraid of being wrong...no one can disagree with you without you turning it into some personal vandebta. <P>And I'm NOT a "rice rocket boy". Most of the cars I've owned have been german. FYI. <BR>||||reg||1
